Modified RustDesk Client — rustdesk-managed-client
Modification date: 2026-09-12
Based on RustDesk OSS 1.4.9, commit 6c578292e8ebbbec708b76986ba8c4bc7c509747.
hbb_common base: 7e1c392c62d39c364127307cd408421dd5f8cfb0.

This is a modified version, not an official RustDesk distribution.
Adds a visible rustdesk-control management module for organization-owned or
explicitly authorized devices: signed enrollment, server policy, managed
permanent password, rotation and heartbeat. It does not modify hbbs/hbbr or
remote desktop protocols. No second OS service is installed.

Original RustDesk copyrights, LICENSE and AGPL notices remain applicable.
Managed additions are provided under AGPL-3.0-only. Distributors must publish
complete corresponding modified source (including hbb_common modifications,
build scripts and notices) at RUSTDESK_MANAGED_SOURCE_URL shown in About.
The separate Go control plane is not part of the upstream RustDesk module.
